# Brand — our living brand book

The canonical Workbooks brand, as a workbook: the petal mark, the flex-bar lockup, the DNA palette,
and the type. Migrated from `web/brand` (a pile of design-exploration HTML) — keeping the *reference*
(the marks specimen + the logo lockup) and dropping the *variants* (hero/section direction experiments,
superseded by the shipped lander). One page, always current, the thing we point people at.

